## Slide 2

Survey: few have detectors, and cost is the barrier

85%

are hostel or PG students

54%

have seen a fire or smoke incident

46%

want a phone alert

Is there a detector where you stay?

Concerns about detectors

What would you pay?

54% have no detector where they stay.

85% say detectors cost too much for common people.

46% would pay ₹500 to 1,000, and 38% would pay more than ₹1,000.

Source: our Google Forms survey. Concerns were multi-select, so the percentages add up to more than 100%.

