NIEHS: WHO report explores effects of e-waste on children's health, 2021 - niehs.nih.gov
CPCB: E-Waste EPR portal (E-Waste Management Rules, 2022) - eprewaste.cpcb.gov.in

Component lifespans other than the MQ-2 and relay are typical estimates; check each datasheet.

